WEBVTT

00:04.180 --> 00:09.810
ずっと信じている

00:04.180 --> 00:09.810
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.180 --> 00:09.810
I have always believed

00:09.940 --> 00:14.320
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:09.940 --> 00:14.320
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:09.940 --> 00:14.320
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.320 --> 00:17.610
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.330 --> 00:31.250
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.330 --> 00:31.250
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.330 --> 00:31.250
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.250 --> 00:33.960
空回りするけど

00:31.250 --> 00:33.960
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.250 --> 00:33.960
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.420 --> 00:37.630
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.420 --> 00:37.630
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.420 --> 00:37.630
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:37.760 --> 00:41.350
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:37.760 --> 00:41.350
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:37.760 --> 00:41.350
You should be yourself.

00:41.470 --> 00:47.190
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.470 --> 00:47.190
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.470 --> 00:47.190
But you know... a messed up scenario

00:48.850 --> 00:54.360
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:48.850 --> 00:54.360
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:48.850 --> 00:54.360
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.360 --> 00:55.860
TRUST MY WAY

00:55.900 --> 01:01.320
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:55.900 --> 01:01.320
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:55.900 --> 01:01.320
The wind... it caresses my cheek.

01:01.580 --> 01:05.000
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.580 --> 01:05.000
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.580 --> 01:05.000
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.000 --> 01:09.880
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.000 --> 01:09.880
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.000 --> 01:09.880
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.000 --> 01:15.510
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.000 --> 01:15.510
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.000 --> 01:15.510
these feelings won't ever change.

01:15.760 --> 01:20.090
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:15.760 --> 01:20.090
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:15.760 --> 01:20.090
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.090 --> 01:23.720
TRUST ME MY WAY

02:05.320 --> 02:10.340
That Vase, It's 5,000,000...

02:24.080 --> 02:25.150
It's cold.

02:36.520 --> 02:40.250
When I woke up, I saw a field completely covered with flowers.

02:42.820 --> 02:44.040
Wow...

02:44.540 --> 02:46.110
What a beautiful place.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.830
Where are we?

02:48.740 --> 02:49.830
Heaven?

02:52.760 --> 02:54.840
Why don't we take a walk and look around?

02:58.340 --> 03:00.040
It's incredible!

03:00.140 --> 03:02.740
I can't believe he has a place this nice in here...

03:03.340 --> 03:05.600
But is it all right, Onee-chan?

03:06.300 --> 03:09.130
That Yoshitaka is the only one here.

03:09.770 --> 03:11.690
It'll be a while before we're found.

03:12.260 --> 03:15.280
Moreover, it's such a waste that he has
a house like this all to himself!

03:15.810 --> 03:19.750
Honestly, this would be a nice place
if that idiot wasn't around.

03:29.870 --> 03:30.840
It reeks of alligator!

03:34.990 --> 03:37.910
But they couldn't have gone far.

03:38.750 --> 03:42.000
After all, the unlikely pairing of
two young runaway girls and an alligator

03:42.160 --> 03:43.960
is sure to stand out.

04:01.770 --> 04:06.390
Living here would mean we'd have to become his maids.

04:06.790 --> 04:09.640
But, Onee-chan, we need work, don't we?

04:10.090 --> 04:11.670
The workload is not the problem,

04:12.200 --> 04:15.520
It's having <i>him</i> as a master.

04:16.060 --> 04:18.100
I think it would be interesting.

04:18.790 --> 04:19.240
That's it!

04:19.460 --> 04:21.530
I have a good idea!

04:22.370 --> 04:23.140
What kind of idea?

04:23.320 --> 04:26.880
Basically, you don't want to let
Yoshitaka-kun do as he pleases, right?

04:27.170 --> 04:28.940
That's true but...

04:29.440 --> 04:30.650
Do you have a good way of doing that?

04:30.900 --> 04:31.760
Yeah, you just-

04:33.860 --> 04:35.560
So you've finally come around?

04:36.070 --> 04:36.940
Yoshitaka!

04:37.440 --> 04:38.740
How long have you...?

04:39.210 --> 04:42.120
Pardon the interruption, but this is <i>my</i> house.

04:42.610 --> 04:46.190
You can neither run nor hide... not like yesterday!

04:46.360 --> 04:48.020
We didn't run away!

04:48.390 --> 04:51.500
Besides, we don't have a place we can go back to!

04:51.550 --> 04:54.310
Ah, now that you mention it, I guess that's true.

04:54.660 --> 04:58.020
Considering the circumstances under which you left home,

04:58.600 --> 05:01.830
I thought about forgetting how rude you
were yesterday and making you my maids again.

05:02.250 --> 05:06.700
The truth is that you want to make us your
maids by any means necessary, isn't that right?

05:06.700 --> 05:09.470
Oh no! Mitsuki-chan understands!

05:09.590 --> 05:11.680
But would you mind not pointing that out? You're not helping.

05:12.760 --> 05:13.440
Hold it!

05:13.520 --> 05:14.900
Don't try and get friendly with her!

05:15.120 --> 05:18.740
Besides, if we wind up working in this house,

05:18.840 --> 05:22.350
it doesn't mean that we're going to do
every little thing that you tell us to do!

05:22.370 --> 05:23.040
Huh?

05:23.370 --> 05:24.510
What are you talking about?

05:25.030 --> 05:26.700
This is <i>my</i> mansion!

05:26.970 --> 05:28.890
What I do with <i>my</i> maids in <i>my</i> house,

05:29.050 --> 05:32.150
when I do it, and how I enjoy myself is <i>my</i> choice!

05:32.700 --> 05:35.440
Mine, mine, and mine alone!

05:35.520 --> 05:37.270
That isn't true at all.

05:37.580 --> 05:39.150
Th-This guy...

05:40.040 --> 05:41.140
That's right.

05:41.140 --> 05:44.470
I already knew that he was this kind of person.

05:44.860 --> 05:48.770
In that case, we'll use this to our advantage and live off him.

05:49.280 --> 05:50.060
It'll be all right.

05:50.540 --> 05:53.620
God will watch over us.

05:58.880 --> 06:03.550
Umm... Could you let us take a bath first?

06:04.450 --> 06:06.320
What's the matter with you lately?

06:06.500 --> 06:07.810
You're not helping.

06:08.010 --> 06:09.490
But Onee-chan,

06:09.740 --> 06:12.380
you kind of smell after falling in the river.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.290
Well, I guess I have no choice.

06:16.880 --> 06:20.770
Camping out must have been cold.
I suppose I can let you use one of my baths again.

06:21.070 --> 06:22.640
Take your time.

06:23.150 --> 06:24.830
We'll continue talking after this.

06:26.240 --> 06:29.630
Unlike you, I won't run away.

06:35.690 --> 06:39.360
By the way, I kind of have a
feeling that I'm forgetting something...

06:40.490 --> 06:42.190
Ah, it's fine.

06:42.340 --> 06:43.850
I'm sure it's nothing important.

06:44.440 --> 06:46.860
This isn't the time to be relaxing!

06:58.150 --> 07:00.100
It really is a nice to have a bath.

07:00.320 --> 07:04.130
It'd be even nicer if we could
use a huge bath like this every day.

07:04.410 --> 07:05.800
Right, Onee-chan?

07:06.230 --> 07:07.210
I suppose.

07:08.620 --> 07:12.550
But this house is too large to live in alone.

07:14.360 --> 07:14.890
That's right!

07:15.640 --> 07:19.030
In the end, even he has no other refuge.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.840
Ah, jeez!

07:23.040 --> 07:26.380
Why am I thinking about him at a time like this?

07:27.630 --> 07:29.730
At least have some self-control...

07:32.610 --> 07:34.990
The battle has already begun!

07:35.340 --> 07:36.840
A lack of preparation is one's greatest enemy.

07:37.140 --> 07:39.260
So now I have miniature cameras hidden
in the walls and eyes inside the bathroom!

07:39.490 --> 07:41.050
See, just like this!

07:42.220 --> 07:43.370
Ah, that's right, Mitsuki.

07:43.610 --> 07:45.920
What was that good idea you
were talking about, earlier?

07:45.260 --> 07:46.610
But the whole time...

07:47.760 --> 07:48.310
Wait-

07:50.560 --> 07:51.340
Huh?

07:51.690 --> 07:52.040
Just-

07:53.360 --> 07:54.530
What the hell?

07:55.510 --> 07:57.340
It's all right.

07:57.440 --> 07:59.270
I have plenty more tricks up my sleeve!

07:59.970 --> 08:02.620
Don't think of me the same way you did yesterday!

08:10.600 --> 08:12.040
Why, you...

08:12.320 --> 08:13.430
YOSHITAKA!

08:13.690 --> 08:14.770
You did it again, didn't you?!

08:14.890 --> 08:17.110
And just what the hell are
we wearing <i>this</i> time?!

08:17.660 --> 08:20.590
Ah, just as I thought.
It suits you to the "T", doesn't it?

08:20.740 --> 08:24.370
You're telling me you <i>planned</i>
on us wearing these perverted clothes?

08:25.600 --> 08:27.100
This much of my back is showing!

08:27.430 --> 08:29.330
The skirt is incredibly short!

08:29.730 --> 08:32.210
And then the garter belts...

08:32.960 --> 08:34.860
This is the first time I've
ever worn something like this.

08:35.260 --> 08:39.160
But you can't have a maid outfit without a garter belt, right?

08:39.530 --> 08:42.920
You become a sexy gal once you put on a garter belt!

08:43.050 --> 08:43.600
Huh?

08:43.720 --> 08:46.010
That's from some RPG, isn't it?

08:43.720 --> 08:52.160
The RPG Mitsuki is talking about is the Dragon Quest series, particularly DQ-3 and DQ-8, where certain equipment can change the characteristics of a player.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.170
Ah, you really know your stuff!

08:47.250 --> 08:48.430
Just leave it to me!

08:48.720 --> 08:51.650
Stop acting so calm and say something!

08:52.160 --> 08:55.200
There's no way we can do our
work while wearing these clothes, right?!

08:56.270 --> 08:57.820
These clothes?

08:58.420 --> 09:00.370
These clothes are cute, aren't they?

09:00.860 --> 09:02.440
That's right!

09:02.490 --> 09:04.900
When Izumi was attacked by the
alligator yesterday, I got a hint

09:05.050 --> 09:06.730
and decided to put a lot of
effort into this new creation.

09:07.400 --> 09:09.470
You can say anything you want,
but when I see you wearing them,

09:09.820 --> 09:11.100
you seem quite pleased.

09:11.290 --> 09:13.670
It's because I don't have anything else to wear, right?!

09:13.920 --> 09:15.570
I really like this part!

09:15.640 --> 09:17.490
Ah, I took special care with that part-

09:17.580 --> 09:18.490
Hey, Mitsuki!

09:18.640 --> 09:20.090
Don't let him influence you!

09:20.250 --> 09:22.790
We haven't yet decided to be his maids or anything yet!

09:22.930 --> 09:24.770
Yes, yes, I forgot.

09:25.250 --> 09:25.880
Here.

09:28.270 --> 09:29.080
What's that?

09:29.250 --> 09:29.540
Table

09:29.250 --> 09:29.880
Chair

09:29.250 --> 09:30.250
Cleaning Service

09:29.250 --> 09:30.630
Flower Vase

09:29.250 --> 09:31.000
Stand

09:29.250 --> 09:31.330
Windowpane

09:29.580 --> 09:33.560
The household items that you broke yesterday.

09:29.670 --> 09:31.710
Carpet

09:30.000 --> 09:32.040
Lawn Repair Fees

09:30.380 --> 09:32.460
Koi

09:30.750 --> 09:32.840
Maid Uniform

09:31.130 --> 09:33.210
Sacred Earthware Tanuk

09:31.500 --> 09:33.750
Name of Article

09:31.710 --> 09:33.750
Cost

09:32.710 --> 09:33.750
Invoice

09:33.560 --> 09:36.370
¥401,280 is worth roughly US$3,780

09:36.370 --> 09:37.210
Forty thou-

09:37.290 --> 09:38.490
Four <i>hundred</i> thousand.

09:38.710 --> 09:40.960
You're going to work hard
and pay off all your debts.

09:41.310 --> 09:42.810
Y-You...

09:43.060 --> 09:44.150
Ah, that's right.

09:44.590 --> 09:45.810
Listen up, you two.

09:46.150 --> 09:47.860
Whenever you address me from now on,

09:47.960 --> 09:50.450
you will call me "Master" or "Yoshitaka-sama."

09:47.960 --> 09:57.900
The suffix "-sama" is an honorific that both exalts the person whose name it is attached to and humbles the person saying it.

09:50.950 --> 09:52.140
You got some nerve!

09:52.290 --> 09:53.570
Give me a break!

09:53.800 --> 09:54.880
Then you're fired.

09:55.170 --> 09:56.350
You can go home by yourself.

09:57.900 --> 10:03.840
You two will personify all that
my heart desires in my mind.

10:04.700 --> 10:07.590
Naturally, the wages for your
services will be more than adequate.

10:07.750 --> 10:12.190
Y-You think you can buy our feelings with money?

10:12.570 --> 10:13.990
Don't you know?

10:14.260 --> 10:16.880
This is how money is used!

10:17.280 --> 10:19.220
I don't need extra money,

10:19.490 --> 10:20.950
so put me in a normal outfit!

10:21.180 --> 10:23.560
That decision isn't up to you.

10:24.120 --> 10:29.130
I just want you two to wear
those outfits and do what I tell you.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.900
There's nothing difficult about it.

10:32.050 --> 10:34.830
Or do you have another prospect you can go to?

10:40.070 --> 10:42.110
You twisted son-of-a bitch...

10:52.380 --> 10:53.070
Pochi!

10:54.360 --> 10:56.120
I-I forgot about the alligator!

10:56.510 --> 10:58.890
Pochi, get that guy!

11:07.070 --> 11:09.060
Why is this happening?!

11:09.540 --> 11:11.520
You monster!

11:09.700 --> 11:11.520
I guess that's Pochi for you.

11:11.770 --> 11:12.720
I'm glad to see it.

11:11.770 --> 11:13.340
Stop!

11:13.060 --> 11:14.640
This is payback for defying me.

11:15.340 --> 11:15.900
Stop It!

11:15.900 --> 11:16.650
That's right!

11:16.730 --> 11:17.440
I remembered!

11:18.040 --> 11:20.830
Say, I have a good idea.

11:18.340 --> 11:18.890
Help me!

11:21.260 --> 11:22.390
Mitsuki, help me!

11:21.440 --> 11:22.990
An idea? About...

11:23.160 --> 11:27.690
What do you think about having
a contest between you and Onee-san?

11:24.040 --> 11:25.140
Nooo!

11:27.510 --> 11:29.330
Stop it, Pochi!

11:28.100 --> 11:28.970
A contest?

11:29.080 --> 11:32.740
We'll say the loser has to listen
to what the winner has to say.

11:31.180 --> 11:32.140
Help me!

11:33.590 --> 11:34.370
Cut it out!

11:34.370 --> 11:35.540
Well, I can roll with that.

11:35.870 --> 11:39.340
So if I win, both of you will
wear those clothes and call me Master?

11:36.370 --> 11:37.540
He found me!

11:40.120 --> 11:40.800
Hey you two!

11:40.840 --> 11:43.500
What are you two still talking about?

11:43.700 --> 11:48.110
In return, if Izumi wins, she can
wear whatever she wants as her uniform,

11:48.540 --> 11:50.840
and I'll multiply her wages.

11:51.640 --> 11:52.410
'Multiply'?

11:55.670 --> 11:57.520
So give me a break!

11:57.610 --> 11:59.840
So what kind of contest are we having?

12:00.840 --> 12:02.040
Let's see...

12:00.840 --> 12:02.200
Nooo!

12:02.200 --> 12:06.440
How about the first one to catch Pochi wins?

12:03.630 --> 12:06.240
You pervert!

12:06.700 --> 12:09.870
Won't Izumi have an advantage there?

12:06.700 --> 12:09.540
Mitsuki, help me!

12:10.070 --> 12:11.240
It'll be fine!

12:10.690 --> 12:11.940
Nooo!

12:11.340 --> 12:13.740
Onee-chan's bad with reptiles.

12:13.340 --> 12:14.440
I hate this!

12:14.050 --> 12:16.610
So I want her to take this
opportunity to get used to them.

12:16.980 --> 12:18.290
We can't do that!

12:18.340 --> 12:19.300
I absolutely refuse to-

12:34.840 --> 12:37.590
Nooo!

12:37.350 --> 12:38.410
What's with this alligator?

12:38.680 --> 12:42.170
For some reason, Pochi tries
to take off Onee-chan's clothes.

12:42.360 --> 12:43.950
So that's why she hates him!

12:45.510 --> 12:47.980
It seems as if she's bad with that alligator.

12:48.520 --> 12:50.250
This might be a piece of cake after all!

12:50.930 --> 12:54.770
In exchange, I'll wear these clothes
and be sure to call you Master

12:54.930 --> 12:58.430
no matter what the outcome of this contest is.

12:58.780 --> 13:05.030
Master... Master... Master...

13:00.830 --> 13:02.430
Well, if that's the case...

13:03.000 --> 13:05.030
Listen to me already!

13:19.260 --> 13:20.250
Are you ready?

13:20.830 --> 13:21.850
The rules are simple...

13:22.110 --> 13:27.020
Whoever catches Pochi first,
Yoshitaka-kun or Onee-chan, is the winner!

13:27.500 --> 13:37.890
So, let the contest...

13:30.610 --> 13:32.870
I had to do this anyway.

13:33.630 --> 13:35.730
But now that I have to do it, I won't lose!

13:37.980 --> 13:39.280
START!

13:43.350 --> 13:45.190
I don't want to do this after all!

13:45.350 --> 13:47.060
Stay away!

13:47.940 --> 13:49.830
There's a scene that could
be taken the wrong way...

13:50.070 --> 13:51.060
No, No!

13:51.780 --> 13:52.490
Izumi, wait!

13:52.540 --> 13:53.730
That room is-

13:57.390 --> 13:57.940
Pochi!

13:58.160 --> 13:59.630
Stay away! Stay away!

14:00.950 --> 14:02.590
NOOO!

14:02.840 --> 14:05.420
MY EXPENSIVE FIXTURES!

14:06.890 --> 14:08.110
S-Stop it, Izumi!

14:12.550 --> 14:14.260
Cut it out you-

14:15.320 --> 14:15.840
Pochi!

14:16.440 --> 14:18.540
Why are <i>you</i> throwing things?!

14:20.990 --> 14:22.120
I have to get away while I can!

14:22.570 --> 14:24.160
No, Onee-chan!

14:25.810 --> 14:26.540
Pochi!

14:26.640 --> 14:28.000
I won't let you get away!

14:29.550 --> 14:30.730
All right, I caught you!

14:35.870 --> 14:39.000
You filthy brutes!

14:39.290 --> 14:41.220
I told you that you shouldn't do that.

14:41.900 --> 14:42.640
Damn it.

14:43.240 --> 14:44.460
Right when I finally caught him.

14:44.630 --> 14:45.990
Is this what's supposed to happen?!

14:50.600 --> 14:52.740
All right, I'll win for sure this time!

14:56.210 --> 14:56.830
Yes, yes.

14:57.050 --> 15:00.700
Pochi absolutely hates being touched by men.

15:00.780 --> 15:01.900
What's that all about?!

15:02.290 --> 15:05.450
If that's how it is,
then I can't go easy on him anymore.

15:06.770 --> 15:07.970
Just wait a minute.

15:10.310 --> 15:11.200
How's this?

15:11.440 --> 15:13.500
My prized battery-powered gun collection!

15:14.670 --> 15:15.200
Huh?

15:15.420 --> 15:16.560
Where'd everyone go?

15:17.130 --> 15:18.510
NOOO!

15:24.510 --> 15:25.500
I'm scared...

15:25.910 --> 15:27.360
Onee-chan, do your best!

15:28.110 --> 15:28.890
All right.

15:28.890 --> 15:30.280
I'll save her now.

15:32.450 --> 15:34.310
Be thankful, Izumi!

15:43.750 --> 15:45.900
DON'T KILL POCHI!

15:53.760 --> 15:55.760
Nooo!

15:56.120 --> 15:56.990
Onee-chan!

15:57.110 --> 15:58.850
Nooo!

16:13.720 --> 16:16.820
Stay away, Pochi!

16:23.250 --> 16:26.450
I said stay awaaaaay!

16:23.340 --> 16:26.450
Wait, Izumi!

16:32.230 --> 16:33.400
That vase...

16:37.920 --> 16:40.470
It's 5,000,000...

17:03.810 --> 17:04.960
Izumi!

17:05.330 --> 17:06.170
Onee-chan!

17:19.450 --> 17:21.240
We're going to live together, just the two of us.

17:22.040 --> 17:23.570
We can't rely on anyone.

17:24.520 --> 17:25.340
It's all right!

17:25.590 --> 17:26.860
Things will work out somehow.

17:28.380 --> 17:34.140
Dad and Mom... someday, they'll understand.

17:46.100 --> 17:46.980
Coming to?

17:47.500 --> 17:50.030
Y-You took care of me?

17:50.650 --> 17:51.040
Yeah.

17:51.370 --> 17:53.410
I'm glad you didn't have any serious injuries.

17:53.890 --> 17:54.730
Where is Mitsuki?

17:55.150 --> 17:56.690
She's making dinner in the kitchen.

17:58.710 --> 18:00.170
That contest earlier...

18:00.660 --> 18:01.820
Izumi!

18:07.870 --> 18:09.890
I lost the contest, didn't I?

18:12.530 --> 18:14.900
